fin-risk:RiskAppetite a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "A Risk Appetite, is a governance statement of the total amount and type of risk an institution is willing to bear, used to anchor risk tolerance and limits to an explicit preference object that may carry both quantitative limits and qualitative statements, so that hard-to-quantify risk is not silently dropped.";
    rdfs:label "Risk Appetite";
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r_791f6ec7f70560cf5c3a297d, _:r_96177ef612dcee44de047462, _:r_986903674ab4b0f6982fbf00, _:r_aaef11b5f0942f4366ce8f99, _:r_bea0dd71c0c0cf919979e29d, _:r_df28d1d419859d0531048878, _:r_f7969c49a2b01d1be9046369, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/ProvenancedFact>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/TemporalFact>.
<https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskAppetite/LogicalIdentity> a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Stable FactIdentity companion for immutable Risk Appetite versions.";
    rdfs:label "Risk Appetite logical identity";
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactIdentity>;
    owl:disjointWith <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>.
fin-risk:RiskBucketSchema a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "A Risk Bucket Schema, is a versioned schema for a bucketed risk result that fixes the bucket dimension, the admissible bucket-key contract, and the Quantity unit shared by all buckets, used to give a complete bucketed risk result a stable and reproducible structure";
    rdfs:label "Risk Bucket Schema";
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r_16519bc55700799c35445ed4, _:r_1e5025be14f6c795aa34eec9, _:r_305ed2b605cd14c64ef29702, _:r_67b007c04a5aabcae22570fb, _:r_861d2ec65d0710cf07adc0a8, _:r_966f5ab55816a665170394ad, _:r_9acca9ede5180f15c288d97e, _:r_9b5482a5b1c9a8030c9e3863, _:r_ba9c7d3a9c83cc22659ad109, _:r_bcbfb7d7f5b682fbb3e06861, _:r_c468ea882e50d87f12d9fba7, _:r_d82836f90b337e9fd046b858, _:r_deeef6341ce000b80db3db26, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/ProvenancedFact>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/TemporalFact>.
<https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSchema/LogicalIdentity> a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Stable FactIdentity companion for immutable Risk Bucket Schema versions.";
    rdfs:label "Risk Bucket Schema logical identity";
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactIdentity>;
    owl:disjointWith <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>.
fin-risk:RiskBucketSet a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "A Risk Bucket Set, is a versioned closure over the RiskBucketValue versions selected by this set version at a specified as-of and generating context that belong to one exact RiskBucketSchema version, used to prove a bucketed result is closed by means of an ordered-set digest and a successful completeness probe. A bucketSetPurpose attribute distinguishes a measurement-side result set from a limit-side schedule, so the same structure is not silently reused as both a value and a threshold. The closure-evidence requirements (bucketValueCount, bucketValueSetDigest, closureProbeRef/Digest, closureCompleted) are mandatory only when the ValidatedReproducibleRiskMeasurement profile is active; a preliminary bucket set may carry its members without a completed closure proof. Membership is frozen at the set version's as-of/context, not a context-free notion of \"current\".";
    rdfs:label "Risk Bucket Set";
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r_00ceb9f928f35a040489ff28, _:r_19af1dffa52404017ff0d2c4, _:r_1a06a9a9f40f1b88307d6f84, _:r_314dababe34f426b57f0c63c, _:r_3228e095013bc3d3f9ef8c46, _:r_5a1c497ebfc6f3ae5737db6c, _:r_7066a52eda3458227aa100f1, _:r_94834c45d22ce55b62b963e6, _:r_c864ba8c515334dab62744a9, _:r_cb95223f2c18ad3e1eac1f5d, _:r_d1ab98c5a89e816993f04c02, _:r_da5e56667ef735dd4b0c0c5a, _:r_e210de1fa33b2f76e8fa182b, _:r_e307eb643fb171238a55affc, _:r_ec1d81607285d219d99ced3e, _:r_f17d099b658c55a6e1b8ae0b, _:r_fb9e23d9ac4511b84f3baca5, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/ProvenancedFact>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/TemporalFact>.
