fin-risk:RiskLimitRule a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "A Risk Limit Rule, is the governed rule a risk limit enforces — an optional lower and/or upper threshold, a comparison operator and basis, a tolerance and rounding policy, a warning/soft/hard severity, and a lifecycle (effective/suspended/superseded) — used so that a limit is not hardcoded to a single upper bound and can express lower bounds, bands, absolute-value limits, two-sided sensitivities, utilization, concentration ratios, and temporary waivers. The single-value<=threshold comparison remains the first concrete profile.";
    rdfs:label "Risk Limit Rule";
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r_041026d1ddbf1d10013f7d49, _:r_0eb1d817844d64210007759e, _:r_1293ac865ef905709b924641, _:r_15c5c95c69f25ff3a90e927a, _:r_37b67c59b0b0711e353cdace, _:r_38cdf6fe9019f97e4ac724ee, _:r_431d3f790731a4a3e9b8e966, _:r_4df3593d186559b121b52e75, _:r_53a825f96e60915c0550dce4, _:r_83fc97d231364121f653f834, _:r_88406035448a3a203e9b32a5, _:r_891ad31d5326f2665cc0211e, _:r_aeef342850a3cbb189401b65, _:r_b428f8506f9edf99ff227ad0, _:r_bf1c5b7a92b8914d873bab98, _:r_dc37438305c89fffef48746c, _:r_e91a3b3e8e8c6f8078011bbb, _:r_f22e37b57576cd16cd5ebff3, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/ProvenancedFact>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/TemporalFact>.
